# The terminal branch of G.2.4

The earlier-clause interface retains the original natural upper action,
marked fixed space, and starred kernel. The terminal implication proves
I=L, S=V_L, the intrinsic A₅-block model, and U=O₂(L₁)≅Q₈∘Q₈.
Its actual quaternion factors meet in V₁, and their multiplication induces
the diagonal-quotient isomorphism.

Relative normality discharges both terminal hypotheses in the literal
§13.5 setup. Earlier clauses (1–7) remain explicit inputs, to be supplied
by the enclosing G.2.4 assembly. Constructing the 13.5.14 source setup
and the other conclusions of 13.5.15 belongs to that chapter's assembly.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript of 1 March 2004,
G.2.4(8), printed pp.334–335; 13.5.14–15, printed pp.919–920.
-/
